     [38;5;246mSingle JSON blob under one key, createPreferences({storage, schema}) factory, declarative defaults/validators. [39m
     [38;5;246mTests need no globals. Slightly more machinery.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m A: blob, direct localStorage
